  "title": "原版战斗主控制器状态转移表（输入 x RAM 状态 -> 下一状态 + 守卫）",
  "implemented": false,
  "implemented_note": "This is a record of the original ROM behaviour. It is not a claim that the remake implements these transitions; the remake still runs its own 24-value phase enum.",
  "boundary": "Scope: the battle-scene layer only -- transitions between the 38 top-level dispatcher states of the original battle controller (0x080732B4..0x0807509C). The nested 0x0809xxxx presentation / message / event layer has its own dispatchers (separate reverse-tree artifact families) and is NOT covered here. A transition that the original performs inside a nested controller (for example the target preview inside 0x4100) is not a top-level transition and must not be listed here.",
