    "legacy_numbering_note": "The 2026-07-23 notes label the dispatcher states with their own 36-state decode. Three of those labels (0x1020, 0x3310, 0x9200) are proven non-existent by the signed per-item assertion, and 0x1220 points at the handler the signed denominator calls 0x1210. This table uses the signed 38-state numbering and keeps the legacy label in \"legacy_labels\" for traceability.",
    "reverse_root": "/Users/altair/github/gba-naruto-reverse"
  },
